WechatMomentExtractor 1.2.0
This read-only derivative includes adapted SQLCipher decryption and read-only
process memory scanning from wechatauto-replica 1.2.4.2:
https://github.com/fanyuantaier/wechatauto-replica
Original project licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0; see LICENSE.
Modifications: removed all UI automation, sending, liking, commenting, message
reading/listeners and media code from the distributed application; restricted
database discovery to sns.db/contact.db; added XML parsing, JSON backups,
read-only desktop viewer, persistent comment selection and isolated tool cache.
The upstream automation application is not imported or packaged.
